                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I choose this game as the first VR experience for my father who is a Navy Veteran, trained on the Missouri in Korean war, and is 85 years old. He was amazed at how accurate everything on the ship was and absolutely loved it. He had no issues at at all, was very comfortable for a 30 minute tour of the ship, so that says alot at his age for the smoothness of the experience. Running 6 level quality on a gtx 1080. He also adapted quickly to the  movement mechanism, very natural. \n\nSo we've only tried 1 ship so far but can highly recommend this game for others with a knowledge or love of these vessels....\n\nWell done.",
